    <body>
        <p><b>Sankskrit Name</b> - Hasta Uttanasana</p>
        <p><b>Benefits</b> - Expands lungs, stretches spine and shoulders.</p>
        <p>&#160;</p>
        <p style="font-weight: bold;">How to Practice</p>
        <ol>
            <li>
                <p>Inhale and raise arms overhead.</p>
            </li>
            <li>
                <p>Gently arch backward, stretching chest and abdomen.</p>
            </li>
        </ol>
    </body>
</html>